  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CAREGIVER",
  "person_4": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Good morning, Mr Ellis. I'm Priya, one of the healthcare assistants. I've brought a sample pot with me for later, if the doctor wants one. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning. That's most kind. I do hope I'm not taking up too much of anyone's time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not at all, Mr Ellis. I'm Dr Morgan. Who have you brought with you? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Hello, doctor, I'm Colette, I'm his carer. I come in morning and evening. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Mr Ellis, what would you say is troubling you most at the moment? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's my sleep, I'm afraid. I'm up and down all night, to the lavatory, and I can't seem to get properly back to sleep."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How many times would you say you get up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four times, perhaps five, most nights. It's been going on for some weeks now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's four, I hear him every time. And he's exhausted in the day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Any burning or stinging when you pass water?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, there's no burning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any blood in the urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No blood, I've looked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go through your medicines. Colette, you manage them, don't you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I do. Amlodipine, 10 mg once a day, and tamsulosin, 400 micrograms once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Forgive me, but I'm quite certain the amlodipine is 5 mg."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's 10, Mr Ellis. I put it in the box every morning, it's on the label."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can't settle that from here, and I'll note both of your views. We'll check the box and the record. Do you have any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I came out in a rash, many years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. And your wider health?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, an enlarged prostate, and type 2 diabetes, which is diet-controlled."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any prostate problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My brother had prostate cancer, in his sixties."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And who's at home with you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I live alone, with Colette's help. My wife passed away four years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm sorry to hear that. Let me examine you. First, no chest pain or breathlessness at all?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing of the sort."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Shall I do the blood pressure, doctor? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please, Priya. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "142 over 86, pulse 72.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Mr Ellis, I'm going to press on your tummy, and then do a gentle rectal exam if you're comfortable. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Certainly.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your bladder isn't enlarged, and the prostate feels smooth and enlarged but not hard."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It fits with what we know. I'd like to send a urine sample today and some blood tests to check your kidneys and sugar."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll take that sample now, if you could come with me, Mr Ellis. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Before you go, try to have less to drink after six in the evening, and avoid tea and coffee in the afternoon."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll make sure of it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you in four weeks, with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
